    "text": "1 days ago SAN ANTONIO — A special proclamation honoring icons of Tejano and Norteño music was presented Tuesday by the Bexar County Clerk and Commissioners Court. They recognized the artists who have shaped the sound and spirit of South Texas and beyond. The proclamation celebrates the musicians' lasting contributions to both culture and music. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
